  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 1, 'Notice one moment today when you feel the pull to talk about someone who is not there, and let it pass with a smile.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 2, 'Mention one kind thing a friend did lately to someone you live with, while that friend is not around.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 3, 'Name one person whose idea helped you lately, and say a quiet thank you to them in your head.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 4, 'Picture someone at home you love, and think of one word that describes them at their best.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 5, 'Listen for one kind thing someone says about another person today, and enjoy hearing it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 6, 'Before you share news about someone this morning, ask yourself whether it is yours to tell.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 7, 'Send a short note to a coworker''s manager naming one specific way the coworker helped you recently.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 8, 'Pass along a tip today and mention who taught it to you by name.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 9, 'If it feels safe and true, tell your kids one thing their other parent does well.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 10, 'After a conversation that turned to gossip, sit for a moment and notice how your body feels.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 11, 'Say only "they''re out today" when someone at work asks why a colleague is away, and leave the reasons to them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 12, 'Tell a parent at pickup one kind thing their child did for your child.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 13, 'If someone repeats an idea a quieter colleague raised in a morning meeting, say whose idea it was first.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 14, 'Over breakfast, mention something kind your partner did that the rest of the household may not have seen.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 15, 'Catch what you usually say first when a certain person''s name comes up, and decide whether you would like to change it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 16, 'Change the subject gently the next time a chat at the bus stop turns to a neighbor''s private business.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 17, 'Name who helped when someone praises a project you worked on together.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 18, 'Ask yourself whether the person would recognize a story as fair before you retell it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 19, 'Help your child name one kind thing a sibling did today when they come to you with a complaint about them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 20, 'Pick a phrase to use when talk turns unkind, such as "I''d rather not talk about them when they''re not here."'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 21, 'Ask "have you talked to them about it?" when a friend vents to you about an everyday annoyance with a third person.'),
