  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 24, 'Give your mother in law or father in law one specific compliment the next time their name comes up.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 25, 'Write a few sentences you would hope a friend would say about you when you are not in the room.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 26, 'Let a rumor stop with you today: hear it, nod, and do not pass it on to anyone.'),
