  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 237, 'Help a friend''s new partner feel welcome by saying something kind about them to the rest of your group.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 238, 'Give credit to the person who first warned of a problem, once everyone agrees it was real.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 239, 'Describe a family tradition warmly to a new friend, and name the relative who started it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 240, 'Ask yourself, "Is it true, is it kind, is it needed?" once today before you speak about someone.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 241, 'Close celebrity gossip sites and magazines for an evening, and read or watch something you love instead.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 242, 'Comment on a friend''s post to thank the person they tagged for helping them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 243, 'Share with a friend a time someone surprised you by being kinder than you expected.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 244, 'Answer one unkind thought about your body today with something you appreciate about what it does for you.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 245, 'Recall a moment today when you wanted to answer an unfair remark but did not, and plan a gentle sentence for next time, without blaming yourself.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 246, 'Answer a juicy text about someone with "Hope they''re okay," and nothing more.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 247, 'Mention a friend''s quiet courage, like starting over after a move, when someone asks how they are doing.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 248, 'Share a fair picture of a former coworker with a new hire, including at least one real strength.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 249, 'Send a thank you text to a sibling for a childhood memory on a cold winter morning.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 250, 'Tell a child you noticed when they stuck up for a classmate, and that you are proud of them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 251, 'Say "That''s between them" kindly when a coworker asks your opinion on two colleagues'' argument.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 252, 'Answer "how was the trip?" by naming the travel companion who made it fun or easy.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 253, 'Indoors on a rainy day, choose a public figure you often mock and find one fair thing to say about their work.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 254, 'Speak well of your child''s teacher at home, so your child hears respect for the adults around them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 255, 'Keep a kind words note on your phone and add one thing you said about someone else today.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 256, 'Reply only to the sender, or not at all, when a coworker emails a "can you believe this" message about someone.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 257, 'Text a friend a kind word about someone you both met at a party, instead of a critique, on the way home.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 258, 'Wait to share your opinion of a new leader, teacher or coach until you have seen them at work for a while.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 259, 'Agree with your household on a kind word or signal to use when talk at home turns into running someone down.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 260, 'Think of a time you heard someone praised before you met them, and how it shaped your first hello.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 261, 'Share just the new plan when an outing changes because of someone, without guessing at their reasons.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 262, 'Show a new coworker which colleagues are generous with help, so they know who to ask.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 263, 'Calmly add your part to the record when someone takes credit for your work, without attacking them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 264, 'Thank a relative who hosted the family gathering by telling the others, as you leave, one thing they did that made it work.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 265, 'Catch how a compliment about someone lands differently when it names something specific, and aim for that kind today.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 266, 'Point out a coworker''s small error to them privately before mentioning it to anyone else.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 267, 'Thank a friend for introducing you to someone, and tell them what you liked about that person.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 268, 'Mention the volunteer who organized a neighborhood event by name when you talk about how good it was.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 269, 'Leave a relative''s past mistakes out of it when you introduce them to your partner''s family.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 270, 'During a break outside, let your mind wander to someone you miss, and think about what you would tell others about them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 271, 'Decline an invitation to a call or coffee that has been set up mainly to talk about someone who will not be there.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 272, 'Turn to the person next to you after a talk, sermon or class, and say what you appreciated about the speaker.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 273, 'Use your new coworker''s name instead of "the new guy" or "the new girl" when you mention them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 274, 'Before a family visit, remind yourself of one good thing about each person who will be there.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 275, 'Remember a time you were relieved that someone kept your secret, and what that trust meant to you.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 276, 'Unfollow or quiet an account that mostly mocks or exposes ordinary people.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 277, 'During an autumn walk with a friend, tell a story in which someone else was the hero.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 278, 'Ask a colleague, "Whose idea was this originally?" before you share a plan further.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 279, 'Say "thank you" instead of "sorry" when family helps you, and let the thanks stand.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 280, 'Look back over your weekend talk and see how much was about people and how much about things you enjoyed.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 281, 'Write yourself a note on a snowy morning about the kind of talk you want to bring into the day.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 282, 'Praise your sibling''s parenting to your parents.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 283, 'Rewrite a complaint about someone into a request: what would you like them to do next time?'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 284, 'Invite each person at the table this evening to say something nice about someone who is not there.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 285, 'Write a thank you note to someone who once defended you when you were not there to hear it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 286, 'Raise a real problem, such as unfair or hurtful behavior, with a manager or HR rather than venting about it in the hallway.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 287, 'Spread the word among neighbors about a local person who started something good, like a little free library or a coat drive.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 288, 'Hold back from judging a family''s choices about school, bedtime or screens, since you see only a sliver of their day.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 289, 'Let sibling squabbles stay between the siblings, rather than retelling them to grandparents as funny stories.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 290, 'Reflect on whether venting helped or kept you stuck, the next time you finish a complaint about someone.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 291, 'Keep a neighbor''s deliveries, visitors and comings and goings out of your chats with other neighbors.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 292, 'Contact a youth league''s coordinator about a referee who stayed fair and calm in a tense game.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 293, 'Let go of an old nickname or story about someone once they have asked people to stop using it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 294, 'Share a grandparent''s story with your kids in a way that shows their courage or humor.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 295, 'Laugh at yourself kindly over a small mistake today, and notice how that softens the way you see other people''s slips.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 296, 'Have one conversation with a coworker today that stays on the two of you and your work.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 297, 'Share with a friend the name of someone online whose posts make your day better, and why.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 298, 'Ask "is this the whole picture?" before you agree that one person is to blame for a group''s problem.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 299, 'Speak kindly about your own parenting after a rough moment: "I''m learning, and that is enough for today."'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 300, 'Notice when your kind words feel forced, and look for something true to say instead.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 301, 'Sit with someone you know only a little at a backyard summer party, and ask about them rather than about people you both know.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 302, 'Report back to the friend who referred you to a good dentist, tutor or mechanic how kind that person was, so the praise travels back.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 303, 'Check that a funny story about a friend is about the situation, not about them, before you tell it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 304, 'On a summer evening, write a short letter to a child in your life about something you admire in them, to give when they are older.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 305, 'Wonder about someone who annoys you: what might they be proud of?'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 306, 'Offer to help a friend plan what to say to the person they are upset with, instead of joining the complaint.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 307, 'Speak well of a retired teacher at a school event or in a parent chat.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 308, 'Before you log off from work, jot down who helped with today''s tasks, so their part is easy to credit later.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 309, 'Keep criticism of a relative''s parenting to yourself unless a child''s safety is at stake, and then tell someone who can help.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 310, 'On a crisp winter night, think of someone who has changed a lot, and whether your words about them have caught up.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 311, 'Cheer for every child on the field from the sidelines, and keep remarks about other families'' kids to yourself.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 312, 'Recommend a repair person to a friend who asks, and say why you found them honest.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 313, 'Include a person''s reason, if you know it, when you pass along a decision of theirs that others might not like.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 314, 'Welcome a cousin''s or sibling''s memory of a shared family event, and let their version stand alongside yours.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 315, 'Practice a gentle line for a friend who often gossips: "You''re funny without that, you know."'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 316, 'Thank a friend who changed the subject away from gossip, since it takes some courage.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 317, 'Offer a short toast or a few words at a birthday or farewell that tells one story about the person''s kindness.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 318, 'When a story starts with "You won''t believe what he did," ask how he might tell it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 319, 'Know that kind words never mean hiding harm: if someone at home is hurting you or a child, tell a person or hotline that can help.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 320, 'Weigh the difference between being honest and being harsh, and practice saying one honest thing kindly.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 321, 'Go easy on yourself if you slip and join in, and simply choose differently in the next conversation.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 322, 'Tell your child what you admire about one of their friends, like how they share or include others.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 323, 'Restate the view of someone you disagree with in words they would accept as fair.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 324, 'Tell a friend plainly that you would rather not talk about your ex today, when you notice the talk turning bitter.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 325, 'Watch whether you speak more kindly about people in the morning or the evening, and plan a tricky conversation for your better time.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 326, 'Check, before posting a photo from a gathering, that everyone in it would be happy to see it shared.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 327, 'Name a quiet player whose effort mattered in an end of season message to the team.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 328, 'On a fall morning, give one person the fresh start you would want, and set aside an old impression of them for the day.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 329, 'Ask your trusted listener to help you spot the good in a relative who simply frustrates you, when you can only see the hard parts.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 330, 'Let a piece of good news about someone else make you glad today, without comparing it to your own life.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 331, 'Vent in a private journal about someone who frustrates you instead of to a mutual friend.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 332, 'Talk about a coworker''s growth, not just their early mistakes, when someone brings up their rough start.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 333, 'Put a coworker''s name in the slide or document credit line for the part they built.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 334, 'Name one thing you did well lately as a partner, parent, sibling or child.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 335, 'Breathe out slowly on your commute and set down any story about someone that you have been turning over in your mind.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 336, 'Protect the privacy of fellow volunteers by leaving their personal details out of chats with your friends.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 337, 'Consider on your commute whose good work goes unseen, and mention it to someone who can see it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 338, 'Say "I''d rather hear it from them" when a rumor about someone''s job or relationship comes up, and change the subject.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 339, 'When a card arrives from family, mention to your household something you appreciate about the sender.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 340, 'Before you pass on a story, check whether you are sharing it to help someone or to feel included.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 341, 'Think of someone you have gossiped about before, on a quiet autumn evening, and silently wish them well.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 342, 'Name a trait you respect in someone you disagree with, during a community or political conversation.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 343, 'Tell others that someone apologized for a mistake, not just that they made it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 344, 'Help a child make a card for a relative, and talk together about what makes that person special.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 345, 'Give yourself credit when you skip gossip today, and say "That was a good choice" to yourself.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 346, 'Drop the word "apparently" from one sentence today, and say only what you know yourself.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 347, 'Paint a warm picture of a chosen family member, such as a godparent or close family friend, when someone asks about your family.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 348, 'Swap "they wanted to" for "it looked to me like" before a sentence about someone''s motives.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 349, 'Visit or call a relative who is often left out of family plans, and tell the others what you enjoyed about the visit.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 350, 'Look for a club or class where people encourage one another, and visit it once.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 351, 'Leave a family member''s big news, like an engagement or a new job, for them to announce, even when you are bursting to share it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 352, 'Ease a friend''s nerves before a new class or job by telling them about a kind person you know there.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 353, 'Believe a child who tells you someone is hurting them, and tell a trusted adult or authority who can keep them safe.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 354, 'Ask your partner what they need from you when they vent about their family, rather than adding complaints of your own.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 355, 'Remember a time your kind words about someone got back to them, and imagine how that felt for them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 356, 'Remember a teammate on your rec league or club who is often talked about, and greet them warmly next time you see them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 357, 'Thank a mentor''s own boss, in a short email, for the time your mentor gives you.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 358, 'At bedtime, think of one person you described today and ask whether your words matched what they did.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 359, 'Share a fond memory of a relative who has died with someone who never met them.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 360, 'Swap answers with a friend about what kind of talk you would each like more of in your lives.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 361, 'End today by naming one moment you chose kindness in how you spoke, however small.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 362, 'Look through old photos with someone and say what you appreciate about each person pictured who is not there.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 363, 'Credit yourself fairly too: when you did part of the work, say so plainly without shrinking it.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 364, 'At night, think of each person in your household and name one thing they did today that you liked.'),
  ('speaking-kindly-about-others', 365, 'Close the day by writing one sentence about how speaking kindly has felt for you this season.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
